# Written here by deploy-flow-fn.sh only, so the deployed function carries the
# map. The original is public/qa-flow/cargomatic.json. Nothing writes this
# locally any more: local-server.mjs used to, once, and never refreshed it,
# which left plans resolving from a months-old snapshot of a map that had moved
# on. If one of these appears outside a deploy, delete it.
infra/flow-run-fn/cargomatic.json

